# Local-only material — never part of Crucible's tree.
# phpunit-main is kept solely to RUN the phpunit binary for black-box
# conformance observation; pest-4.x solely to consult Pest's public
# docs when maintaining spec/pest-api.md; mockery-main solely to RUN
# Mockery black-box when maintaining spec/mockery-api.md. No source
# is a design input (see DESIGN.md), and none ships in this repository.
# Oracles: real installs of other people's software, kept out of the
# tree and rebuilt from ORACLES.md. What REBUILDS an oracle is source
# and is tracked (inertia-oracle/entry.mjs, .github/fixtures/*); what
# the rebuild PRODUCES is not.
/livewire-oracle/
/inertia-oracle/node_modules/
/inertia-oracle/inertia.js
/phpunit-main/
/phpcpd-main/
/pest-4.x/
/mockery-main/
/browser-oracle/

